{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19230","headline":"詶淮南牛相公述旧见贻 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶淮南牛相公述旧见贻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年曾忝汉庭臣，晚岁空余老病身。\n初见相如成赋日，寻爲丞相扫门人。\n追思往事咨嗟久，喜奉清光笑语频。\n犹有登朝旧冠冕，待公三入拂埃尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}